# Academic Role

Owns academic ops only: students, instructors, courses, activations, certificates, agreements, reports. No research, finance, payments, or system/settings/roles.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Students · Instructors · Courses · Student Activations · Certificates · Instructor Agreements · Reports · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard work queue

Stats: Total Students, Total Instructors, Active Courses, Pending Course Reviews, Pending Student Activations, Pending Certificates.
Tables: Pending Course Reviews (Review), Pending Activations (View), Pending Certificates (Review). No research stats / no notification card.

## Key flows

- **Activation**: Academic submits for existing student → Super Admin final approval → Active
- **Course**: Pending Review → Approve / Reject (+reason) / Request Revision
- **Certificates**: Pending Review → verify completion → Approve / Reject
- **Agreements**: Academic upload/assign/version; instructor view/download only
